  "job_B1.6.2.2_20251001_193254": {
    "chunk_text": "st, & he ortuwigen ne sceal ahwar beo Godes fultume. Gyf God by\u00f0 his gefylste, ne by\u00f0 his mihte forseowen, for \u00fean \u00fee nan mihte nis buten of Gode, se \u00fee He awyrp\u00fe \u00fea modige of heora mihtesetle, & ahef\u00f0 \u00fea eadmede, \u00fe\u00e6t eall middeneard beo Gode Se seofo\u00f0e un\u00f0eaw is \u00fe\u00e6t se cristene man beo sacfull. Of Cristes name is christianus gehaten, \u00fe\u00e6t is se cristene mann, \u00fee on Criste is gefulhtod. Gyf he \u00feonne by\u00f0 sacfull, ne by\u00f0 he so\u00f0lice cristene. Nis nan mann so\u00f0lice cristen, bute se \u00fee Criste geefenl\u00e6ce\u00f0. Crist sylf nolde fliten, swa swa his F\u00e6der cw\u00e6\u00f0 beo him, Efne her is min cild \u00fee me is swy\u00f0e leof, & Ne flitt he mid ceaste, ne saca ne astyre\u00f0, ne on str\u00e6te ne gehyr\u00f0 \u00e6nig mann his st\u00e6mne. He cw\u00e6\u00f0 eac on his godspelle, \u00fe\u00e6t \u00fea by\u00f0 Godes bearn, \u00fea \u00fee gesibsume by\u00f0, & saca ne astyrige\u00f0. Swa swa \u00fea gesibsume so\u00f0lice Godes bearn by\u00f0, swa by\u00f0 eac \u00fea sacfulle so\u00f0lice deofles bearn. Ealle we clypige\u00f0 to Gode & cwe\u00f0e\u00f0, Pater noster, \u00feu ure f\u00e6der \u00fee eart on heofone. Ac we ne mugen habben \u00feone heofonlice e\u00f0el bute we fram eallen sacan orsorge beon. Se ehte\u00f0e un\u00f0eaw is, \u00fe\u00e6t se \u00feearefe beo modig. Manig mann n\u00e6fe\u00f0 \u00e6hte, & hafe\u00f0 modignysse swa \u00feeh, &",
